# Antigravity Rules for ENSO RONI Dashboard

## Rules & Standards
- Keep the NOAA feed parsing compatible with the vertical structure (`SEAS`, `YR`, `ANOM`). Never use melt configurations that expect wide 12-season columns.
- Ensure all charts show the last 24 months clearly.
- Maintain X-axis label optimization: only show every 3rd season label, rotated at 45 degrees.
- Do not check in `.venv` or local configuration folder assets; always preserve `.gitignore`.
- Ensure changes made to the app are mirrored both in the test workspace and the OneDrive folder copy.
- Keep the Memory Bank (`/memory-bank/`) files updated whenever major context or schema transitions occur.
